---

<BaseLayout title={`top 10 最佳輕量無線吸塵器 | 10Best Living`} description={`Find the lightest, most powerful cordless vacuum for effortless cleaning. 我們對 suction, battery, and ease of use.`} path={`/blog/top-10-best-cordless-vacuums-lightweight`}>
  <script type="application/ld+json">{JSON.stringify(jsonLd)}</script>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="blog-hero-image relative h-64 lg:h-80 overflow-hidden">
      <img src="/images/cordless-vacuum.jpg" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
